 "remarks": "Beautifully maintained and move-in ready on a peaceful private lane, this 2014-built home offers four finished levels of thoughtfully designed living space - ideal for everyday life, working from home, and entertaining. At the heart of the home is a bright, open-concept chef's kitchen with two islands, made for casual dining, meal prep, and gathering. Sunlight fills the main living areas throughout. Upstairs, the second floor holds a generous primary suite plus three additional bedrooms, including one privately set in its own wing with a full bath - perfect for guests, an in-law arrangement, or a private secondary living space. The third floor is a work-from-home dream: a dedicated office (or fifth bedroom), a comfortable sitting area, and a full bath. The finished lower level adds even more room to spread out, with a large playroom or media room and a dedicated home gym. Offered fully furnished - just unpack and settle in. Enjoy everything Westport has to offer: top-rated schools, a vibrant downtown, and beautiful beaches and coastal living close by. Long term tenant preferred....",
